\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_21\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Get-Content -LiteralPath phases/20-girder-end-asymmetry/step0-report.json -Encoding utf8; Write-Output '--- invoke/index json shape ---'; Get-Content -LiteralPath phases/20-girder-end-asymmetry/step0-invoke.json -Encoding utf8; Write-Output '--- phase tracked state ---'; git ls-files phases/20-girder-end-asymmetry\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ADR-032의 다섯 분해항은 음수가 되지 않고 세 위치별 본수 불변식을 보존한다\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"range\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s, c, e ∈ [0, 12]^3; 2,197조합\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"counterexamples\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": [],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"through=min(s,c,e), startStub=max(0,s-c), endStub=max(0,e-c), centerOnly=max(0,c-max(s,e)), oneSided(始端)=max(0,min(s,c)-e), oneSided(終端)=max(0,min(c,e)-s)를 스크래치 전수 계산했다. s=through+startStub+oneSided(始端), c=through+centerOnly+oneSided(始端)+oneSided(終端), e=through+endStub+oneSided(終端)가 전 조합에서 성립했다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"始端定着 편측근과 終端定着 편측근은 동시에 양수가 아니다\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"range\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s, c, e ∈ [0, 12]^3; 2,197조합\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"counterexamples\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": [],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"두 항의 동시 양수 조건은 각각 e<min(s,c), s<min(c,e)이므로 e<s와 s<e를 동시에 요구한다. 전수 계산에서도 동시 양수 0건이었다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"what\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"각 분해 그룹은 始端→中央→終端에서 연속한 한 구간으로 해석된다\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"range\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s, c, e ∈ [0, 12]^3; 양수인 각 항의 위치 서명\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"counterexamples\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": [],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"through=SCE, startStub=S, endStub=E, centerOnly=C, oneSided(始端)=SC, oneSided(終端)=CE로 분류했다. 비연속 서명 SE(始端과終端에는 서지만中央에는 없는 본)는 어떤 항에도 생성되지 않았다. 예시 (6,4,9)는 through=4, startStub=2, endStub=5로 두 단부 스텁으