200 ??뼀???뗦? ??鶯곥겏?뚣걯?↓쟿\",\r\n          \"memberKind\": \"佯딀씮\",\r\n          \"clearXMm\": 5600,\r\n          \"clearYMm\": 5600,\r\n          \"pitchMm\": 200,\r\n          \"openings\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"xMm\": 2400,\r\n              \"yMm\": 2400,\r\n              \"widthMm\": 1200,\r\n              \"heightMm\": 1200\r\n            }\r\n          ],\r\n          \"expected\": {\r\n            \"alongX\": {\r\n              \"totalCount\": 29,\r\n              \"groups\": [\r\n                {\r\n                  \"deductionMm\": 0,\r\n                  \"count\": 24\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                  \"deductionMm\": 1200,\r\n                  \"count\": 5\r\n                }\r\n              ]\r\n            },\r\n            \"alongY\": {\r\n              \"totalCount\": 29,\r\n              \"groups\": [\r\n                {\r\n                  \"deductionMm\": 0,\r\n                  \"count\": 24\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                  \"deductionMm\": 1200,\r\n                  \"count\": 5\r\n                }\r\n              ]\r\n            }\r\n          },\r\n          \"handDerivation\": \"1?싧뎴8) ??깿?먦굮?먦굢?ゃ걚?귝쑍??竊???600첨200?됵펻1 竊?29?곦퐤營?겘 0??00?삘╉꺕5600?괱?밧릲嶺뗣겘?뗥룭??y ?끾퀡 (2400,\r\n 3600) ??냵??2600??400 ???с걣 ?뗥룭??x 野멩퀡 1200 ?믤쵟?띲갳?밧릲嶺뗣겘?앫겗?녴겎?뚣걯?겹겓?ゃ굥竊덃??밧숱??뼀?ｃ겒??겎竊?\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\nAt line:2 char:193\r\n+ ... tests/golden/fixtures/quantity-r5-ch3.json | ConvertFrom-Json | Out-N ...\r\n+                                                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : NotSpecified: (:) [ConvertFrom-Json], ArgumentException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : System.ArgumentException,Microsoft.PowerShell.Commands.ConvertFromJsonCommand\r\n \r\nquantity-json-ok\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
